  {
   "id": "pawbay-381357@1.0.2",
   "gameId": "pawbay-381357",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-04T08:21:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45892595/72e998ad2b2ce3599bab4ff83592a0e21048ee22.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've prepared a new updated with the promised camera changes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As part of this update, camera handling was further reworked. It won't travel as aggressively, and will follow your cat in a more predictable manner.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Additionally, we've changed some textures, especially around the central town plaza, that could've been causing feelings of nausea when running in a circular motion.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changes to camera movement",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Replaced environmental textures that could've been causing dizziness",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45892595/b9821bd2016d90cf49a8206067d73793ef36ff42.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As the launch sale is nearing its end, we would like to thank you all for helping us with a successful release! More content for Pawbay is coming closer to winter.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please consider leaving your feedback and writing a review if you haven't yet! It is your support that allows us to further refine the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45892595/7af539987c762ae5ce953b7ed5e96cf9f5169aa5.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
