  {
   "id": "pawbay-381357@1.0.1",
   "gameId": "pawbay-381357",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-08-24T15:04:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Meow everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've issued a patch based on your initial feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cloud saving has been enabled.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Camera controls have been improved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Cloud Saves",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Starting with this update, your save file is now exposed locally, and available for Steam upload. Each time you end your play session, Steam will upload this file to the save cloud, ensuring you can access it from other devices and future installations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You don't need to do anything for this change to take place. Cloud saves should simply work from now on.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Camera Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The camera now moves a bit more smoothly, and doesn't stick to the cat's rear. This should result in a less dizzying experience. Some adjustment to the dynamic FoV have also been made.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is only an initial tweak. We're looking to re-work controls further, so make sure to let us know how they feel! We haven't had any issues with motion sickness internally, so we rely on your feedback to improve the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you've enjoyed the game, please review it and tell us your impressions. You can also post your ideas in the Bugs & Feedback sub-forum in the community tab.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45892595/8cbfb71943d9a701bb333b8e983828fef8139dfd.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
