  {
   "id": "pawbay-381357@major-2026-05-04",
   "gameId": "pawbay-381357",
   "displayName": "Paw-some Update: New Cover, Trailer & Local Co-op Reveal!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-05-04T10:05:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’re purr-oud to share something new with you… 🐾",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve refreshed our cover art!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45892595/48cc5438fe3d557222e6d4b816ff796d09c95ad6.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But wait… there’s more 👀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Even more pawsome things are on the way!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45892595/8cbfb71943d9a701bb333b8e983828fef8139dfd.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cats may have nine lives… and we’re using every single one to make this game the best it can be 🐈",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re alive, kicking, and working hard behind the scenes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We don’t want to spoil all the surprises (where’s the fun in that?), but we can let a little secret slip:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👉 Local co-op is coming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Grab your favorite human (or fellow chaos gremlin) and",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "scratch,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "jump,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "knock things over (including small humans 😼),",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "and cause adorable mayhem together!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45892595/f9e6178d8b52c80290d723fb8849ed2e01e0e6a2.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And that’s not all…",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There are even more ways to play together waiting to be discovered!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So… what do you think? Are you ready for the purrfect cat life? 🐾",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Let us know - and don’t forget to spread the word!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
